<article class="follow-area">
  <h1>Follow Lighthouse</h1>
  <p>Choose an Atom feed for your reader. Findings are reviewed against sources; essays are interpretation. The watch-notice feed contains only dated notices from released findings. Story feeds mix reviewed notices with daily entries whose titles and categories always say <strong>unreviewed</strong>.</p>
  <p>Feeds exclude drafts. A date without a source time is represented at midnight UTC for the feed; that is a calendar date, not a measured event time.</p>
